# Reordering the Today view is not an undo step: undo after it takes back the earlier edit and leaves the new order as it was.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
	- Pay rent @due({today})
END
keys gt G T
keys <A-k> <A-k>
see ▌ - Pay rent  Work
keys z
see ▌ - Pay rent  Work
keys j x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
	- Pay rent @due({today})
END
